Decision: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines schema for decision entities.

Required:
  @decision <id>
  topic <topic>
  choice <choice>
  status <status>

Optional:
  because:
    - <reason>
  reject:
    - <alternative>
  risk <LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH|CRITICAL>
  supersedes <id>
  owner <role>
  evidence <evidence-list>

Example:
  @decision DEC-042
  topic cache
  choice redis
  because:
    shared-state
    low-latency
    existing-infra
  reject:
    memcached
    db-cache
  risk medium
  status accepted

State: +
  